{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Unto Hamor his father, saying.</b> The sense of <b>saying</b> (לאמר) is that he should say thus to Jacob; or it serves to reinforce the matter, meaning a definitive utterance that will be fulfilled. And so with Laban (Genesis 31:29): אמש אמר אלי לאמר. And so with Potiphar's wife (Genesis 39:14): ותאמר להם לאמר ראו הביא לנו."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:17:31.038804529Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}